1
00:00:10,427 --> 00:00:11,428
N-No way...

2
00:00:11,512 --> 00:00:12,596
He's...

3
00:00:12,763 --> 00:00:16,141
I redirected the shockwaves
into the ground.

4
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,769
But you really startled me
with that move!

5
00:00:19,228 --> 00:00:21,355
I honestly had no clue
the Righteous Egg

6
00:00:21,438 --> 00:00:23,565
held this much power.

7
00:00:26,151 --> 00:00:30,614
<i>His aura is much more powerful
and larger than the last Devils'...</i>

8
00:00:31,657 --> 00:00:32,866
<i>I was a fool.</i>

9
00:00:33,367 --> 00:00:35,994
<i>I never had a chance.</i>

10
00:00:36,787 --> 00:00:39,081
<i>Father, I'm so sorry.</i>

11
00:00:39,748 --> 00:00:44,503
<i>I wasn't good enough, after all.</i>

12
00:00:45,546 --> 00:00:50,592
Most Devils have two horns...
Do you know why I have three?

13
00:00:51,510 --> 00:00:53,804
A Devil's horns are
a sign of their power.

14
00:00:54,388 --> 00:00:57,057
The more horns they have,
the more powerful they are.

15
00:00:58,976 --> 00:01:00,185
<i>The White Demon...</i>

16
00:01:00,269 --> 00:01:01,687
So, do you get it now?

17
00:01:01,853 --> 00:01:04,439
You picked the wrong fight.

18
00:01:04,523 --> 00:01:05,691
That's enough!

19
00:01:06,650 --> 00:01:07,608
Don't be so impatient.

20
00:01:07,609 --> 00:01:09,611
I'll kill you nice and slow, later.

21
00:01:10,028 --> 00:01:12,489
Miss Elizabeth...

22
00:01:12,573 --> 00:01:13,532
How does it feel?

23
00:01:14,283 --> 00:01:16,994
To die without saving your father?

24
00:01:17,661 --> 00:01:19,830
Well, it's a meaningless bond,
I guess.

25
00:01:20,122 --> 00:01:21,790
Maybe it isn't worth fretting over.

26
00:01:22,416 --> 00:01:23,834
You can die now.

27
00:01:24,418 --> 00:01:25,419
<i>Is this it?</i>

28
00:01:29,798 --> 00:01:30,882
K-Keiji?

29
00:01:31,049 --> 00:01:32,551
B-Brother...

30
00:01:32,593 --> 00:01:34,386
What are you trying to pull
at this point?

31
00:01:35,887 --> 00:01:38,098
I'm not done with you yet!

32
00:03:20,826 --> 00:03:23,870
EPISODE 11
IT TAKES TWO WINGS TO FLY

33
00:03:29,626 --> 00:03:30,836
<i>I feel so lonely.</i>

34
00:03:31,420 --> 00:03:34,089
<i>I wonder when Father will return?</i>

35
00:03:34,673 --> 00:03:36,216
Hey, Keisuke...

36
00:03:36,466 --> 00:03:40,011
I hear your old man has another
new girlfriend!

37
00:03:40,512 --> 00:03:41,930
- Liar!
- Your dad's a man whore

38
00:03:41,972 --> 00:03:44,182
- Cheater!
- Man whore!

39
00:03:44,516 --> 00:03:46,852
What did you say?!
Don't disrespect my father!

40
00:03:46,935 --> 00:03:48,186
Now you've done it!

41
00:03:48,562 --> 00:03:50,355
- Stay down, ya wimp.
- Don't mess with us!

42
00:03:50,397 --> 00:03:53,024
Father...
Help me! Father!

43
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:54,734
Cut it out, you guys!

44
00:03:55,402 --> 00:03:56,445
Kasumi!

45
00:03:56,528 --> 00:03:59,614
Stop it!
You're hurting Keisuke!

46
00:03:59,865 --> 00:04:03,994
<i>Kasumi, the girl I l-l-love,
is defending me?!</i>

47
00:04:04,453 --> 00:04:06,288
Shut up!

48
00:04:06,746 --> 00:04:07,747
Beat her up too!

49
00:04:07,789 --> 00:04:09,624
Tough talk coming from a girl...

50
00:04:09,666 --> 00:04:12,794
- Idiot!
- Stop it! Help!

51
00:04:12,919 --> 00:04:16,715
Keisuke, help me!

52
00:04:19,634 --> 00:04:22,012
<i>I'm so sorry, Kasumi...</i>

53
00:04:23,805 --> 00:04:25,515
...is what my Mom said!

54
00:04:26,141 --> 00:04:27,893
- That's hilarious.
- Right?

55
00:04:28,226 --> 00:04:29,227
Um...

56
00:04:29,895 --> 00:04:35,609
Th-Thank you for standing up
for me yesterday.

57
00:04:36,610 --> 00:04:38,987
- Let's go.
- Yup, let's go.

58
00:04:41,615 --> 00:04:43,033
<i>What was I supposed to do?</i>

59
00:04:43,700 --> 00:04:46,119
<i>Anybody would run
in that situation.</i>

60
00:04:46,703 --> 00:04:47,954
<i>It's not my fault.</i>

61
00:04:48,413 --> 00:04:49,456
Keisuke.

62
00:04:50,332 --> 00:04:51,500
Have you been a good kid?

63
00:04:51,750 --> 00:04:52,834
F-Father!

64
00:04:53,043 --> 00:04:54,336
When did you get home?

65
00:04:54,544 --> 00:04:55,670
Just now.

66
00:04:55,962 --> 00:04:59,174
Keisuke, I have something important
to talk to you about.

67
00:05:01,218 --> 00:05:02,302
W-What?

68
00:05:02,552 --> 00:05:05,055
Y-You want me to fight Demons?

69
00:05:05,180 --> 00:05:08,350
Why me?
You're joking, right?

70
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:09,726
I'm serious.

71
00:05:09,935 --> 00:05:13,772
It's time for you to fulfill
the Goshikidori Family's destiny.

72
00:05:13,939 --> 00:05:17,776
Starting today, I will teach you
the Path of the Heavenly Fist.

73
00:05:18,151 --> 00:05:19,986
This is so sudden...

74
00:05:20,111 --> 00:05:23,448
I can't do something like that!

75
00:05:23,615 --> 00:05:27,828
What's a Goshikidori?
What are you talking about?

76
00:05:29,830 --> 00:05:32,707
It's a Demon, Keisuke!
Come with me!

77
00:05:32,999 --> 00:05:34,042
W-What?!

78
00:05:34,876 --> 00:05:37,671
Let me sing!!

79
00:05:37,838 --> 00:05:41,049
Listen to me hum a tune!!

80
00:05:48,765 --> 00:05:50,350
<i>A-Amazing...</i>

81
00:05:51,142 --> 00:05:54,563
<i>He beat that giant monster
so easily...</i>

82
00:05:57,315 --> 00:05:58,149
Father...

83
00:05:58,358 --> 00:06:01,152
Can I become as strong
as you one day?

84
00:06:01,653 --> 00:06:04,781
Yes. You have the same blood
flowing through your veins!

85
00:06:08,410 --> 00:06:09,744
<i>I have to give it my all.</i>

86
00:06:10,537 --> 00:06:14,040
<i>I'm going to become a cool warrior
just like Father!</i>

87
00:06:14,749 --> 00:06:18,336
15, 16, 17...

88
00:06:19,004 --> 00:06:21,798
21, 22...

89
00:06:25,385 --> 00:06:26,595
You're wide open!

90
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:35,645
Father, do I have the talent
to be a warrior?

91
00:06:36,146 --> 00:06:40,567
Keisuke, do you know
what true strength is?

92
00:06:40,859 --> 00:06:42,694
I-I don't...

93
00:06:43,570 --> 00:06:46,031
It's the one thing that you have
to find yourself, Keisuke.

94
00:06:46,865 --> 00:06:49,200
Until then, you must train.

95
00:06:52,203 --> 00:06:54,456
<i>I trained like hell...</i>

96
00:06:54,748 --> 00:06:56,666
<i>But never found the answer...</i>

97
00:06:57,626 --> 00:07:01,588
<i>Was my strength all just for show?</i>

98
00:07:02,339 --> 00:07:03,381
<i>To be honest...</i>

99
00:07:03,715 --> 00:07:05,967
<i>Wanting to save the world
was just a front...</i>

100
00:07:06,468 --> 00:07:09,804
<i>I just wanted to be like Father...</i>

101
00:07:10,347 --> 00:07:12,265
<i>Nothing's changed since that day...</i>

102
00:07:13,683 --> 00:07:16,936
<i>It's a miracle I even got this far,
for being so worthless...</i>

103
00:07:17,854 --> 00:07:21,066
<i>I did everything that I could.
I have no regrets</i>

104
00:07:25,820 --> 00:07:28,573
<i>Big Brother...
What are you doing?</i>

105
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:31,993
<i>You're weaker than I am.
You don't stand a chance!</i>

106
00:07:32,369 --> 00:07:33,787
<i>Just stop now...</i>

107
00:07:35,455 --> 00:07:36,706
Are you crazy?

108
00:07:36,873 --> 00:07:38,625
What can you do in that condition?

109
00:07:39,334 --> 00:07:41,211
What else is there to do?

110
00:07:41,670 --> 00:07:44,130
I'm going to kick your ass.

111
00:07:44,214 --> 00:07:45,590
Keiji, stop!!

112
00:07:45,674 --> 00:07:47,759
You're going to die
if you keep going!

113
00:07:48,593 --> 00:07:49,803
<i>Listen to me, Hikari.</i>

114
00:07:50,303 --> 00:07:52,347
<i>You must not kill that one.</i>

115
00:07:52,806 --> 00:07:55,599
<i>Instead, try pushing him
right to the brink of death.</i>

116
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:57,852
<i>I want to test a theory.</i>

117
00:07:58,770 --> 00:08:01,022
<i>Why is she so interested in him?</i>

118
00:08:05,819 --> 00:08:06,903
Keiji!

119
00:08:12,409 --> 00:08:13,410
Mo...

120
00:08:13,910 --> 00:08:14,911
Morio!

121
00:08:16,162 --> 00:08:19,082
Keiji! I've wanted to see you!

122
00:08:19,165 --> 00:08:20,834
How have you been?!

123
00:08:21,876 --> 00:08:23,920
Morio... you're killing me...

124
00:08:24,003 --> 00:08:26,506
Oh! S-Sorry!

125
00:08:27,382 --> 00:08:28,508
Are you okay?

126
00:08:28,591 --> 00:08:29,884
Y-Yeah...

127
00:08:30,468 --> 00:08:31,469
Where's Piyoko?

128
00:08:31,678 --> 00:08:32,679
Over there.

129
00:08:33,096 --> 00:08:38,393
She risked her life to defeat
the monster in my head.

130
00:08:38,601 --> 00:08:40,311
I owe her my life.

131
00:08:41,730 --> 00:08:43,815
<i>Not bad, Piyoko!</i>

132
00:08:44,315 --> 00:08:46,943
Keiji, I heard what you did.

133
00:08:47,152 --> 00:08:49,696
How you came to save me.

134
00:08:49,821 --> 00:08:52,365
You're such a good guy!

135
00:08:53,199 --> 00:08:55,368
I just happened to be passing by.

136
00:08:55,410 --> 00:08:57,537
What?!
Is that right?

137
00:08:57,829 --> 00:08:59,330
Either way, I'm happy!

138
00:08:59,414 --> 00:09:01,124
<i>What's up with this conversation?!</i>

139
00:09:01,666 --> 00:09:02,917
Even so...

140
00:09:03,126 --> 00:09:06,379
I'm very angry at that guy.

141
00:09:06,796 --> 00:09:08,256
Controlling us Demons...

142
00:09:08,339 --> 00:09:10,550
Making us destroy towns...

143
00:09:10,633 --> 00:09:12,802
Making trouble for
Keiji and his friends...

144
00:09:13,178 --> 00:09:16,222
My heart hurt all that time.

145
00:09:16,681 --> 00:09:18,683
I'm never... letting you...

146
00:09:19,017 --> 00:09:20,643
...get away with this!

147
00:09:26,858 --> 00:09:27,859
Morio!

148
00:09:37,869 --> 00:09:39,037
Morio!

149
00:09:42,624 --> 00:09:44,709
Know your place, trash.

150
00:09:46,002 --> 00:09:47,504
You bastard!!

151
00:09:51,591 --> 00:09:52,592
<i>Something's off.</i>

152
00:09:52,801 --> 00:09:55,136
<i>Why isn't he finishing us off?</i>

153
00:09:55,470 --> 00:09:56,805
<i>Is he toying with us?</i>

154
00:10:10,610 --> 00:10:13,655
Keiji... please stop already!

155
00:10:14,614 --> 00:10:16,616
<i>You've done enough, Big Brother...</i>

156
00:10:17,117 --> 00:10:18,660
<i>You fought well.</i>

157
00:10:19,452 --> 00:10:21,788
<i>But it's no use...</i>

158
00:10:22,455 --> 00:10:24,833
<i>We totally lost...</i>

159
00:10:32,298 --> 00:10:33,800
Keiji...

160
00:10:34,926 --> 00:10:39,681
Sorry, but I'm a stubborn bird.

161
00:10:39,848 --> 00:10:40,723
Stop!

162
00:10:42,100 --> 00:10:45,436
<i>How does he still
have the strength?</i>

163
00:10:45,770 --> 00:10:47,647
<i>H-How?</i>

164
00:10:48,064 --> 00:10:50,817
<i>You're weaker than I am,
but how can you still fight?</i>

165
00:10:51,442 --> 00:10:55,321
<i>He doesn't stand a chance...
Why isn't his spirit broken?!</i>

166
00:10:55,613 --> 00:10:56,614
<i>Keisuke!</i>

167
00:10:57,157 --> 00:10:59,784
<i>Do you know what true strength is?</i>

168
00:11:03,204 --> 00:11:05,790
<i>Father, I understand now.</i>

169
00:11:06,708 --> 00:11:11,838
<i>Ever since I was young,
I blamed others for my problems.</i>

170
00:11:12,005 --> 00:11:15,508
<i>I made excuses and
ran from my problems.</i>

171
00:11:16,134 --> 00:11:19,095
<i>My heart is just so weak!</i>

172
00:11:19,596 --> 00:11:21,931
<i>I never wanted to admit it.</i>

173
00:11:22,932 --> 00:11:24,684
<i>I didn't want to acknowledge
my own weakness.</i>

174
00:11:25,643 --> 00:11:26,644
<i>Big Brother...</i>

175
00:11:27,312 --> 00:11:28,688
<i>You're strong...</i>

176
00:11:29,689 --> 00:11:31,191
<i>He overcame his painful past.</i>

177
00:11:31,357 --> 00:11:33,109
<i>He doesn't cower in fear.</i>

178
00:11:33,193 --> 00:11:37,030
<i>He believes in himself,
and lives on his own terms!</i>

179
00:11:38,323 --> 00:11:39,532
<i>To be honest...</i>

180
00:11:39,699 --> 00:11:41,576
<i>I've always wanted to be...</i>

181
00:11:43,953 --> 00:11:46,998
<i>a man like you, Big Brother!</i>

182
00:11:49,375 --> 00:11:50,501
What is this?

183
00:11:50,752 --> 00:11:52,754
Power is growing deep inside of me.

184
00:11:56,007 --> 00:11:57,842
Could it be?

185
00:11:58,843 --> 00:12:00,053
<i>Through your training,</i>

186
00:12:00,136 --> 00:12:02,679
<i>your Righteous Egg should
be powerful enough</i>

187
00:12:02,680 --> 00:12:04,641
<i>to undergo a second awakening.</i>

188
00:12:05,475 --> 00:12:09,312
<i>If you do so,
you can unlock a new power.</i>

189
00:12:09,687 --> 00:12:11,898
<i>The rest is up to your heart.</i>

190
00:12:12,273 --> 00:12:14,192
<i>My heart?!</i>

191
00:12:14,317 --> 00:12:17,737
<i>Discover the meaning of
true strength, Keisuke.</i>

192
00:12:24,661 --> 00:12:26,079
Playtime is over.

193
00:12:26,579 --> 00:12:28,289
<i>In the end, nothing happened...</i>

194
00:12:28,915 --> 00:12:31,292
I'll let you live for now.

195
00:12:40,885 --> 00:12:42,344
I was able to reach
Second Awakening

196
00:12:42,345 --> 00:12:43,429
thanks to you, Brother.

197
00:12:43,930 --> 00:12:44,889
Thank you.

198
00:12:45,098 --> 00:12:46,557
Leave the rest to me.

199
00:12:49,519 --> 00:12:52,230
<i>The meaning of true strength is...</i>

200
00:12:53,231 --> 00:12:55,775
<i>The strength to believe
in yourself to the end!</i>

201
00:12:56,567 --> 00:12:57,610
I'll no longer...

202
00:12:57,777 --> 00:12:59,362
...give up!

203
00:13:02,824 --> 00:13:04,117
<i>What was that?</i>

204
00:13:04,409 --> 00:13:06,703
<i>That attack came out of nowhere!</i>

205
00:13:10,164 --> 00:13:13,459
Mama... this is getting interesting!

206
00:13:14,502 --> 00:13:16,838
<i>W-What just happened?</i>

207
00:13:17,422 --> 00:13:20,842
<i>It's like he transformed
into someone else!</i>

208
00:13:21,801 --> 00:13:23,845
Keisuke... are you?

209
00:13:24,345 --> 00:13:26,431
Miss Elizabeth,
may I ask you a favor?

210
00:13:26,806 --> 00:13:28,766
Will you use this chance
to find my father?

211
00:13:29,183 --> 00:13:31,561
He's probably being held
inside the factory.

212
00:13:31,602 --> 00:13:32,770
But...!

213
00:13:33,021 --> 00:13:36,649
Please leave this to me.
I will defeat him.

214
00:13:39,193 --> 00:13:40,320
Understood.

215
00:13:40,820 --> 00:13:41,988
I know you can do it.

216
00:13:42,196 --> 00:13:43,448
Thank you.

217
00:13:43,614 --> 00:13:44,532
Keiji.

218
00:13:44,949 --> 00:13:46,659
Don't you dare die on me.

219
00:13:48,202 --> 00:13:49,662
Please beat him!

220
00:13:49,829 --> 00:13:50,830
Got it!

221
00:13:52,790 --> 00:13:53,791
This time around...

222
00:13:53,916 --> 00:13:55,334
I'll protect everyone!

223
00:13:58,838 --> 00:13:59,839
<i>Here he comes!</i>

224
00:14:02,008 --> 00:14:03,009
<i>I can see it!</i>

225
00:14:08,431 --> 00:14:09,432
<i>Amazing...</i>

226
00:14:09,766 --> 00:14:13,436
<i>So, this is the Righteous Egg's
Second Awakening.</i>

227
00:14:14,937 --> 00:14:16,939
Why you...

228
00:14:19,609 --> 00:14:20,651
There's no escape!

229
00:14:35,708 --> 00:14:36,751
<i>That's it!</i>

230
00:14:38,252 --> 00:14:40,379
Hiding in the rubble...

231
00:14:40,505 --> 00:14:42,173
...Goshikidori?!

232
00:14:43,257 --> 00:14:44,258
Where is he?

233
00:14:47,178 --> 00:14:49,514
<i>Fifth Fist Heavenly Path!</i>

234
00:14:51,015 --> 00:14:54,060
<i>Ultra-Explosive Chicken Leg!</i>

235
00:15:08,616 --> 00:15:10,618
I won...

236
00:15:19,502 --> 00:15:22,630
What changed you?

237
00:15:23,297 --> 00:15:25,299
My brother awakened
my inner strength.

238
00:15:26,134 --> 00:15:27,343
I see...

239
00:15:27,844 --> 00:15:29,303
So, you were siblings.

240
00:15:29,679 --> 00:15:30,680
Also...

241
00:15:31,472 --> 00:15:33,683
I have to save my father.

242
00:15:34,517 --> 00:15:36,853
My father is my inspiration.

243
00:15:38,813 --> 00:15:39,647
I see...

244
00:15:40,690 --> 00:15:45,069
So I was
defeated by family bonds...

245
00:15:46,696 --> 00:15:49,323
...a true bond.

246
00:15:50,658 --> 00:15:51,784
Bonds...

247
00:15:52,243 --> 00:15:53,286
<i>Hikari...</i>

248
00:15:54,453 --> 00:15:57,999
<i>Hikari... my precious Hikari...</i>

249
00:15:58,666 --> 00:16:01,586
<i>Who... is that?</i>

250
00:16:06,132 --> 00:16:07,175
What?!

251
00:16:20,813 --> 00:16:22,815
Sorry about that, Mama...

252
00:16:23,399 --> 00:16:27,236
I got caught off guard, myself...

253
00:16:34,785 --> 00:16:36,370
Not here either...

254
00:16:36,495 --> 00:16:38,873
Where is Keisuke's father?!

255
00:16:40,166 --> 00:16:41,876
- There he is!
- Oops.

256
00:16:42,376 --> 00:16:43,502
Wait!

257
00:16:44,879 --> 00:16:47,882
What's the matter, fly up
and get him, dumb chicken!

258
00:16:47,965 --> 00:16:49,508
Who are you calling dumb?

259
00:16:49,675 --> 00:16:51,093
Hi, Sophia?

260
00:16:51,135 --> 00:16:52,386
Activate "Jet" please.

261
00:16:52,762 --> 00:16:53,846
Roger.

262
00:16:56,599 --> 00:16:57,725
Hold it!

263
00:16:57,808 --> 00:16:59,435
What?! Damn it!

264
00:17:00,937 --> 00:17:02,813
Let that rooster go!

265
00:17:02,897 --> 00:17:04,982
Why would I do that, dummy?!

266
00:17:05,233 --> 00:17:07,151
Call me a dummy again!

267
00:17:08,778 --> 00:17:09,779
Damn it!

268
00:17:11,781 --> 00:17:12,782
She's closing in!

269
00:17:13,991 --> 00:17:14,992
Damn it!

270
00:17:15,701 --> 00:17:18,454
From the looks of it,
that was a Kappa Demon.

271
00:17:18,496 --> 00:17:21,749
So, if we fight underwater,
I'll be at a disadvantage.

272
00:17:23,876 --> 00:17:25,586
<i>Looks like she isn't coming in.</i>

273
00:17:25,753 --> 00:17:27,755
<i>Guess it's a war of attrition.</i>

274
00:17:27,838 --> 00:17:32,468
<i>Screw my orders.
Not my problem if this one dies.</i>

275
00:17:36,764 --> 00:17:38,849
Ow!

276
00:17:39,100 --> 00:17:42,103
Looks like I was passed out.

277
00:17:43,646 --> 00:17:44,689
Is that...

278
00:17:44,897 --> 00:17:47,775
How long will you keep running,
Goshikidori!

279
00:17:51,320 --> 00:17:54,323
<i>Both his speed and power
have increased significantly.</i>

280
00:17:54,657 --> 00:17:56,659
<i>He can regenerate,</i>

281
00:17:56,701 --> 00:17:58,744
<i>there's no point in
attacking him relentlessly.</i>

282
00:17:58,911 --> 00:18:00,788
<i>I need to target his vitals.</i>

283
00:18:01,372 --> 00:18:03,623
Playtime is over.

284
00:18:03,624 --> 00:18:04,959
Take this!

285
00:18:07,878 --> 00:18:08,796
You fell for it!

286
00:18:08,838 --> 00:18:10,965
Now this is what I call a birdcage!

287
00:18:11,090 --> 00:18:13,342
Damn it! It's so dark,
I can't see anything!

288
00:18:15,845 --> 00:18:17,680
Welcome to hell!

289
00:18:18,014 --> 00:18:19,807
Savor it.

290
00:18:23,853 --> 00:18:25,146
<i>It's no use trying to see.</i>

291
00:18:25,813 --> 00:18:26,688
<i>I need to feel it.</i>

292
00:18:26,689 --> 00:18:27,690
<i>Listen...</i>

293
00:18:27,940 --> 00:18:29,483
<i>Feel how the air is moving!</i>

294
00:18:34,989 --> 00:18:36,782
<i>I got it!
It's so clear!</i>

295
00:18:37,074 --> 00:18:40,661
<i>I see, the Second Awakening has
made my senses sharper!</i>

296
00:18:41,829 --> 00:18:42,788
Why can't I hit him?!

297
00:18:43,122 --> 00:18:44,123
<i>I can do this!</i>

298
00:18:47,752 --> 00:18:48,794
What?!

299
00:18:49,211 --> 00:18:50,212
Damnー!

300
00:18:51,505 --> 00:18:55,051
Ultra Explosive Chicken Leg!

301
00:19:01,349 --> 00:19:02,350
What?!

302
00:19:03,601 --> 00:19:05,436
His head wasn't his weak spot?!

303
00:19:07,772 --> 00:19:08,606
That'sー!

304
00:19:09,231 --> 00:19:11,233
He's regenerating from that orb!

305
00:19:15,655 --> 00:19:16,947
<i>I don't wanna!</i>

306
00:19:17,448 --> 00:19:18,866
<i>I don't wanna fight!</i>

307
00:19:19,659 --> 00:19:21,869
<i>Please, it hurts!</i>

308
00:19:22,078 --> 00:19:23,079
<i>Mama...</i>

309
00:19:23,454 --> 00:19:24,789
<i>Hikari...</i>

310
00:19:25,790 --> 00:19:27,124
<i>You must fight.</i>

311
00:19:28,542 --> 00:19:30,711
Of course, Mama.

312
00:19:31,170 --> 00:19:34,590
A brutal death will be
my gift to them!

313
00:19:38,969 --> 00:19:42,723
Die, die, die, die, die,
die, die, die, die, die!

314
00:19:42,807 --> 00:19:44,600
<i>He's going completely berserk!</i>

315
00:19:44,725 --> 00:19:48,312
<i>He's become totally erratic
and unpredictable!</i>

316
00:19:51,857 --> 00:19:52,858
Keisuke...

317
00:19:53,275 --> 00:19:55,695
Die, die, die, die, die, die!

318
00:19:56,737 --> 00:19:57,822
Morio!

319
00:19:58,072 --> 00:20:01,283
I still got a grudge against you.

320
00:20:01,367 --> 00:20:04,662
You're still alive, you half-wit?

321
00:20:04,745 --> 00:20:08,582
Evil folks like you
can't be left alive.

322
00:20:09,291 --> 00:20:12,586
Wait... Don't... Morio!

323
00:20:15,881 --> 00:20:18,801
Get crushed!

324
00:20:19,301 --> 00:20:20,678
Why you...

325
00:20:23,973 --> 00:20:24,849
Morio!

326
00:20:25,266 --> 00:20:27,852
Even if I die, I won't let go!

327
00:20:33,858 --> 00:20:35,025
K-Keiji...

328
00:20:35,693 --> 00:20:40,906
I'm sorry... I couldn't be useful...

329
00:20:40,990 --> 00:20:41,991
Bye-bye.

330
00:20:42,324 --> 00:20:45,369
Stop!!

331
00:20:56,672 --> 00:20:58,841
M-Morio...

332
00:21:04,221 --> 00:21:08,684
How unfortunate, just when
he had regained his senses.

333
00:21:08,976 --> 00:21:13,314
But his life didn't mean anything, anyway.

334
00:21:13,606 --> 00:21:15,691
He was just trash, right?

335
00:21:16,859 --> 00:21:19,236
<i>I was born a fluke.</i>

336
00:21:21,197 --> 00:21:24,575
<i>I had a reason to live, after all!</i>

337
00:21:33,667 --> 00:21:37,338
Bastard... How dare you...

338
00:21:37,880 --> 00:21:40,132
do that to Morio...

339
00:21:41,383 --> 00:21:43,594
Brother... could that beー?!

340
00:21:44,720 --> 00:21:46,555
<i>What is that?
What are you doing?</i>

341
00:21:54,855 --> 00:21:57,942
Finally,
his Righteous Egg is...

342
00:21:58,442 --> 00:22:01,111
Mark my words, you bastard!

343
00:22:02,655 --> 00:22:05,449
I will end you!

344
00:23:50,763 --> 00:23:51,972
Is it all over?

345
00:23:52,181 --> 00:23:53,849
We haven't settled it, Brother!

346
00:23:54,016 --> 00:23:55,059
That's right, Keiji!

347
00:23:55,309 --> 00:23:56,393
Don't let your guard down!

348
00:23:56,518 --> 00:23:58,562
It's all about duty, Mister!

349
00:23:58,729 --> 00:24:01,190
Next time: "What the Birds,
Beasts and Trees Share."

350
00:24:01,315 --> 00:24:04,234
Each and every last one of them
makes my crown curl!

351
00:24:04,944 --> 00:24:09,865
FAN ART CONTEST AWARDS

